# conclusion

In this work, we demonstrated problems with gradient penalty in WGAN and introduced an alternative in the form of a total variational regularization in the objective function, which enforce the 1-Lipschitz constraint on the discriminator implicitly. The new approach is much stable in training. Additionally, we introduced a margin factor to control the trade-off between generative diversity and visual quality.

