# loss_curves

[FIGURE: EBMs w/ noisy dynamics]

In Figure [REF:loss plot], we plot the loss curve along the training of models with noisy or noise-free dynamics on CIFAR-10. We observe that for both models, the losses oscillate around zero, as observed in [CITE:nijkamp2020anatomy]. However, the model trained with noisy dynamics diverges after 20000 iterations, while the the training of model with noise-free dynamics is much more stable. In addition, we observe that adding the extra generator loss as discussed in section [REF:gan connection section] does not affect the training stability.

